\mbox{curl} \vec F = 
\left|
\begin{array}{ccc}
 \quad\vec i\quad \amp \quad  \vec j\quad \amp \quad \vec k\quad \\
\frac{\partial}{\partial x} \amp  \frac{\partial}{\partial y} \amp 
\frac{\partial}{\partial z}\\
\cos\mathopen{}\left(y\right) \amp  \sin\mathopen{}\left(z\right) \amp  6x^{3}
\end{array}
\right|
=\left(\frac{\partial}{\partial y}(6x^{3}) - \frac{\partial}{\partial z}
(\sin\mathopen{}\left(z\right))\right)\vec i
